      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "大旦那様が、いなくなってしまったの！\nこのダグシオンからは出ていないと思うけど……\n上の方は見たから、下層が怪しいわね。\n一緒に大旦那様を探して！　御願いよ！",
        "official_en": "My master is missing! I don't think he's left Dagsion,\nbut I've already looked all over hightown for him!\nHe must be somewhere in the lower levels. Please\nhelp me find him!",
        "real_en": null
      },
